Engine: Ollama / Llama 3.1 (LoRA fine-tune)
Date: 2026-06-16
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. MODEL IDENTITY
─────────────────
  Name         : Black Belt Ethical Auditor (BBEA)
  Base         : meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct (dev) / 70B-Instruct (prod)
  Runtime      : Ollama (local) or vLLM (production API)
  Quantization : Q4_K_M (8B local) / FP16 (70B production)
  Adapter      : LoRA rank 16, alpha 32, dropout 0.05
  Target layers: q_proj, v_proj, k_proj, o_proj

